  "description": {
    "raw": "This spell functions as the minor creation spell, except the object created is a semi-real illusion. Any creature that interacts with the object may make a Will save, with success causing the object to cease to exist. A gnome casting this spell may make a Spellcraft check in place of any Craft check required to make a complex item.",
    "search_text": "\"this spell functions as the minor creation spell, except the object created is a semi-real illusion. any creature that interacts with the object may make a will save, with success causing the object to cease to exist. a gnome casting this spell may make a spellcraft check in place of any craft check required to make a complex item.\"",
